    },
    "**Alarms are off.** Urgent nudges, and so every Relentless nudge, now come as Time Sensitive notifications, which silent mode can mute." : {
      "comment" : "Permission banner, when alarms are off and Time Sensitive is on. Keep the first sentence bold."
    },
    "**Alarms are off.** Urgent nudges, and so every Relentless nudge, now come as ordinary notifications, which silent mode can mute and a Focus can hold." : {
      "comment" : "Permission banner, when alarms and Time Sensitive are both off. Keep the first sentence bold."
    },
    "**All clear.** Nothing needs you right now." : {
      "comment" : "Now: the Nudging section when nothing is nudging."
    },
    "**Notifications are off.** Nudges can't reach you." : {
      "comment" : "Permission banner, when notifications and alarms are both off. Keep the first sentence bold."
    },
    "**Notifications are off.** Only Urgent nudges can reach you, as alarms: every Relentless nudge, and a Firm reminder's from nudge 4 with Break Through Focus on. Gentle reminders can't reach you at all." : {
      "comment" : "Permission banner, when notifications are off but alarms are allowed. Keep the first sentence bold."
    },
    "**Nudge %lld** at +%@" : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges row: one nudge and how long after the due time it comes. 1: the nudge's number. 2: a duration, such as \"45 min\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "**Nudge %1$lld** at +%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Nudge %lld** when due" : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges row: the first nudge, which comes at the due time. The placeholder is its number, 1."
    },
    "**Nudges %lld–%lld** at +%@" : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges row: a run of nudges and how long after the due time the first comes. 1: the first nudge's number. 2: the last's. 3: a duration, such as \"52 min, 30 sec\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "**Nudges %1$lld–%2$lld** at +%3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Nudges %lld–%lld** when due" : {
      "comment" : "How It Nudges row: a run of nudges from the first, which comes at the due time, each one wait after the last. 1: the first nudge's number, 1. 2: the last's.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "**Nudges %1$lld–%2$lld** when due"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Nudging now.** Start, repeat, strength, pace and Break Through Focus are locked while it's nudging. Mark it Done or pause it to change them. A new title shows from the next nudge." : {
      "comment" : "Top of the Edit Reminder form while the reminder is nudging: why five fields are locked."
    },
    "**Time Sensitive is off.** High nudges come as ordinary notifications, so a Focus can hold them." : {
      "comment" : "Permission banner, when the app's Time Sensitive notifications are turned off. Keep the first sentence bold."
    },
    "A new schedule applies from the next time it's due. A new strength, pace or Break Through Focus setting applies from the next nudge." : {
