    "Cancel" : {
      "comment" : "Closes the alert without choosing a new time.\nKeeps the reminder instead of deleting it.\nKeeps the tag instead of deleting it.\nSettings: keeps your data instead of deleting it.\nThe form's cancel button (an xmark).\nThe tag sheet's cancel button (an xmark)."
    },
