    "Done" : {
      "comment" : "My Day's filter sheet: closes the sheet.\nMy Day: a Nudging row's swipe action that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nMy Day: the button on a Nudging row that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nMy Day: the caption of the count of occurrences done today.\nNotification action: marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nNudge card's swipe action: marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nNudge card: the button that marks the reminder Done and stops its nudges.\nStatus label: an occurrence closed as Done.\nTags: leaves Edit mode.\nThe tag sheet's confirm button (a checkmark)."
    },
